WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:20.291
I'm not backing off.

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:22.458
Just give me some space.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:23.958
I came to do a job.

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:26.958
I'm asking your permission to do it.

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:28.833
All right.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:47.916
[screams]

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:13.708
[grunts]

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:20.833
[grunts]

00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:59.166
[birds chirping]

00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:20.458
Dracula's castle.

00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:22.833
Astonishing.

00:02:23.541 --> 00:02:24.791
It's really quite--

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:26.666
Ugly as sin.

00:02:26.708 --> 00:02:28.041
It's not ugly.

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:29.708
It's ugly.

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:31.041
And it's sad.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.458
And it's cold.

00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:34.708
Bad things happened here.

00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:38.041
That's my childhood home
you're talking about.

00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:39.958
Well, that explains a lot.

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:41.083
Sorry.

00:02:41.166 --> 00:02:43.333
Some places just have a chill on them.

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:46.333
Maybe my people and I
can warm it up a little.

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.833
It's magnificent.

00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:50.208
And there.

00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:52.458
The Belmont Hold, I believe.

00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:54.791
This, my dear lady,

00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:58.458
may be the most important place
in the modern world.

00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:02.041
At this moment, it is the best defense
I can think of.

00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:04.833
Welcome to my home.

